@startuml intent_interaction_states
' 设计原因：答案被接收不等于业务完成；保留提交与投递之间的状态差异。
!pragma layout smetana
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
title 业务待补充项的生命周期
state "等待回答\nPENDING" as Pending #FFF1DA
state "答案已接收\nANSWER_ACCEPTED" as Accepted #E8EEF8
state "答案已应用\nRESOLVED" as Resolved #E5F1EC
state "已过期\nEXPIRED" as Expired
state "已取消\nCANCELLED" as Cancelled
state "已被新问题替代\nSUPERSEDED" as Superseded
state "投递无法安全继续\nDELIVERY_FAILED" as Failed #FBE8E8
[*] --> Pending : 登记问题
Pending --> Accepted : 校验通过并原子接收
Pending --> Expired : 到期
Pending --> Cancelled : 取消任务
Pending --> Superseded : 变更问题或动作版本
Accepted --> Resolved : 原处理方确认应用答案
Accepted --> Failed : 按投递失败规则终止
Resolved --> [*]
legend bottom
RESOLVED 不是任务成功；仍缺信息时登记新的问题。
终态不得再次接收答案；失败处置见正文失败处理表。
endlegend
@enduml

